1
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:49,480
=No.9 Hunter=

2
00:00:49,480 --> 00:00:51,400
=Episode 3=

3
00:00:59,320 --> 00:01:01,000
Where are we?

4
00:01:03,039 --> 00:01:04,359
You're back to normal.

5
00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:08,239
(Why am I a woman again?)

6
00:01:08,799 --> 00:01:10,519
(It seems the Stone Curse
is affected by him,)

7
00:01:10,519 --> 00:01:11,680
(causing Yin-Yang imbalance.)

8
00:01:11,799 --> 00:01:13,959
(My form keeps shifting.)

9
00:01:23,680 --> 00:01:24,760
Do you feel like...

10
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:28,000
We're slowly losing our senses.

11
00:01:28,120 --> 00:01:30,519
No! We've fallen into
the Deceit Beast's barrier.

12
00:01:30,640 --> 00:01:32,599
If we don't break it soon,

13
00:01:32,760 --> 00:01:35,120
we'll be consumed in here.

14
00:01:35,120 --> 00:01:35,920
A barrier...

15
00:01:36,920 --> 00:01:39,159
Every barrier has its core.

16
00:01:49,040 --> 00:01:50,480
Found it.

17
00:01:54,879 --> 00:01:56,079
This is ancient divine script.

18
00:01:56,480 --> 00:01:57,799
The Wind God Chronicle says

19
00:01:58,560 --> 00:02:00,480
only an ancient divine artifact
can break it.

20
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:06,439
(Isn't that me?)

21
00:02:07,160 --> 00:02:08,761
Are you alright?

22
00:02:10,520 --> 00:02:12,759
(Young Taoist, you can't die.)

23
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:15,000
(If you die, what do I eat?)

24
00:02:45,199 --> 00:02:46,120
It's broken.

25
00:02:48,199 --> 00:02:49,960
How did you decipher the stele?

26
00:02:50,879 --> 00:02:52,240
I am one with the Divine Stone.

27
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:53,840
Of course I could break it.

28
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:57,000
Still, I never expected

29
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:59,879
a Deceit Beast
to possess such a treasure.

30
00:03:25,400 --> 00:03:26,240
Your hand.

31
00:03:37,960 --> 00:03:38,879
Pretty.

32
00:03:38,879 --> 00:03:40,120
Amazing.

33
00:03:40,719 --> 00:03:41,599
The pain is gone.

34
00:03:43,080 --> 00:03:45,840
You're not bad.

35
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:47,479
This is pretty.

36
00:03:48,319 --> 00:03:49,120
Thanks.

37
00:03:50,919 --> 00:03:52,240
You just saved me.

38
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:57,340
(I saved you so I can eat you.)

39
00:03:57,340 --> 00:03:58,541
(Young Taoist.)

40
00:04:02,639 --> 00:04:04,400
I can sense the Deceit Beast. Let's go.

41
00:04:22,480 --> 00:04:23,279
Demon.

42
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:26,079
What did you do to those brides?

43
00:04:26,319 --> 00:04:27,920
I sent them home.

44
00:04:28,079 --> 00:04:28,959
Home?

45
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:39,279
Do you know the truth
about this village?

46
00:04:43,439 --> 00:04:44,439
This is Demon Essence.

47
00:04:44,800 --> 00:04:47,079
It stores everything
the demon saw and knew.

48
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:53,399
Countless women
were persecuted by this village.

49
00:04:54,319 --> 00:04:56,199
Those villagers are not innocent.

50
00:04:56,959 --> 00:04:58,560
- They called it ghost weddings,
- (Mother! Save me!)

51
00:04:58,560 --> 00:05:00,879
but they were trafficking
and imprisoning women.

52
00:05:01,439 --> 00:05:03,360
They tortured them to death.

53
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:06,120
You think you're serving justice,

54
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:08,480
but you're actually helping the wicked.

55
00:05:11,280 --> 00:05:12,360
Their crimes

56
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:14,399
are for human law to judge.

57
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:16,439
But you used your power to harm people.

58
00:05:17,519 --> 00:05:19,120
By law, you must die.

59
00:05:21,160 --> 00:05:22,480
Just because he is a demon,

60
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:24,480
even doing good is wrong?

61
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:25,560
You'd still kill him?

62
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:26,319
A demon

63
00:05:26,760 --> 00:05:27,920
is still a demon.

64
00:05:29,279 --> 00:05:30,759
His cause may be just,

65
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:32,959
but his actions are bloody and violent.

66
00:05:32,959 --> 00:05:33,839
He defies the heavenly order.

67
00:05:33,839 --> 00:05:34,759
It can't be forgiven.

68
00:05:35,519 --> 00:05:37,199
When evil like this exists,

69
00:05:37,199 --> 00:05:38,680
I have the right
to fight fire with fire.

70
00:05:38,680 --> 00:05:40,560
You stand on your moral high ground,

71
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:41,959
preaching the divide
between humans and demons,

72
00:05:41,959 --> 00:05:42,920
judging right and wrong.

73
00:05:43,160 --> 00:05:44,600
Aren't you just another oppressor?

74
00:05:44,600 --> 00:05:45,519
If order is written in blood,

75
00:05:45,519 --> 00:05:46,600
how is that different from evil?

76
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:47,680
If order collapses,

77
00:05:47,680 --> 00:05:48,839
good and evil become meaningless.

78
00:05:48,839 --> 00:05:50,480
Fighting fire with fire
only fuels more hate

79
00:05:50,480 --> 00:05:51,639
and creates greater evil.

80
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:53,879
This demon...

81
00:05:54,199 --> 00:05:55,199
I must take him.

82
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:57,439
Your so-called order,

83
00:05:57,639 --> 00:05:59,240
is just their cover-up.

84
00:05:59,519 --> 00:06:00,639
And my path

85
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:02,240
is to overturn this very order.

86
00:06:09,560 --> 00:06:11,600
The Deceit Beast's sting can control

87
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:12,639
whoever it pierces.

88
00:06:12,959 --> 00:06:14,439
It can take over his mind

89
00:06:14,439 --> 00:06:16,319
and make the bite mark appear.

90
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:27,120
I still can't control my heart.

91
00:06:27,879 --> 00:06:29,160
Love unfulfilled.

92
00:06:29,160 --> 00:06:30,480
Blows unstruck.

93
00:06:30,959 --> 00:06:32,399
You two are trapped

94
00:06:32,399 --> 00:06:33,480
in this love-hate entanglement.

95
00:06:33,800 --> 00:06:34,639
It's your tribulation.

96
00:06:35,319 --> 00:06:36,120
It is sin.

97
00:06:45,480 --> 00:06:47,600
(Why hasn't the bite mark appeared?)

98
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:49,240
(Let me figure this out.)

99
00:06:52,040 --> 00:06:52,839
No.

100
00:06:53,319 --> 00:06:55,120
Why does the full moon have to come now?

101
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:02,759
I've been using the Stone's power
too often lately.

102
00:07:03,600 --> 00:07:05,399
The backlash is hitting hard.

103
00:07:06,319 --> 00:07:08,600
Forget it. I'm eating him.

104
00:07:15,759 --> 00:07:16,920
No bite mark.

105
00:07:17,199 --> 00:07:18,959
What if I can't break the Curse?

106
00:07:19,319 --> 00:07:20,720
This male form is useful after all.

107
00:07:20,879 --> 00:07:22,720
It eases the Curse's backlash.

108
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:25,639
The bite mark.

109
00:07:26,160 --> 00:07:28,800
Now's my chance.
I'll drain your Spirit Essence.

110
00:07:37,959 --> 00:07:39,079
Kill her!

111
00:07:39,079 --> 00:07:39,600
(No.)

112
00:07:39,759 --> 00:07:41,237
(I forgot the Deceit Beast's sting)

113
00:07:41,237 --> 00:07:42,319
(can cloud a person's mind)

114
00:07:42,319 --> 00:07:43,399
(and make them bloodthirsty.)

115
00:07:43,560 --> 00:07:44,360
Kill!

116
00:07:46,560 --> 00:07:47,439
Kill!

117
00:07:49,279 --> 00:07:51,279
Kill! Kill!

118
00:07:51,720 --> 00:07:52,600
This is bad.

119
00:07:52,600 --> 00:07:53,399
I can't hold the Curse back.

120
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:55,639
I think I'm a woman again.

121
00:07:55,639 --> 00:07:56,439
You fool Taoist, wake up!

122
00:07:56,600 --> 00:07:57,319
Stop fighting!

123
00:07:58,399 --> 00:07:59,240
Kill!

124
00:07:59,399 --> 00:08:00,240
(Then, I...)

125
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:01,360
(have to kill you.)

126
00:08:08,480 --> 00:08:09,560
Kill!

127
00:08:11,639 --> 00:08:12,279
Kill!

128
00:08:14,639 --> 00:08:15,560
(This is bad.)

129
00:09:01,799 --> 00:09:03,440
I eat.

130
00:09:10,440 --> 00:09:11,559
Ow! That's hard.

131
00:09:28,559 --> 00:09:29,360
Hungry again?

132
00:09:33,679 --> 00:09:35,440
It's all that Deceit Beast's fault.

133
00:09:35,440 --> 00:09:36,360
That sting of his

134
00:09:36,480 --> 00:09:38,000
has way too much staying power.

135
00:09:39,600 --> 00:09:40,440
Where's the Deceit Beast?

136
00:09:41,879 --> 00:09:42,679
I let it go.

137
00:09:43,279 --> 00:09:44,080
Let it go?

138
00:09:44,080 --> 00:09:44,879
Mm.

139
00:09:44,960 --> 00:09:45,879
You let it go?

140
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:46,799
Mm.

141
00:09:46,879 --> 00:09:47,679
Mm.

142
00:09:48,919 --> 00:09:49,720
Thank you.

143
00:09:50,399 --> 00:09:51,200
Mm.

144
00:09:54,720 --> 00:09:56,559
You were testing me last night,
weren't you?

145
00:09:57,519 --> 00:09:58,919
I'm a Taoist.

146
00:09:58,919 --> 00:10:00,559
Keeping him would have put me in a bind.

147
00:10:01,200 --> 00:10:02,559
But after everything that has happened,

148
00:10:02,679 --> 00:10:04,200
I see you're not an evil demon.

149
00:10:06,960 --> 00:10:08,639
Letting him go was the right call.

150
00:10:08,960 --> 00:10:10,320
But you stung me with that thing.

151
00:10:11,300 --> 00:10:12,559
What was your plan?

152
00:10:14,799 --> 00:10:16,519
What was my plan?

153
00:10:17,000 --> 00:10:18,120
To kill you.

154
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:19,799
Happy now?

155
00:10:20,639 --> 00:10:21,440
Tch.

156
00:10:21,879 --> 00:10:22,799
You couldn't do it.

157
00:10:23,879 --> 00:10:26,159
I don't know
where you get that confidence.

158
00:10:37,120 --> 00:10:38,200
Do you still remember

159
00:10:38,200 --> 00:10:39,360
when you were a kid,

160
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:41,559
you were bitten by something

161
00:10:41,559 --> 00:10:42,559
really, really, really cute?

162
00:10:43,039 --> 00:10:44,519
Really, really cute.

163
00:10:46,860 --> 00:10:48,300
Like a kitten or a puppy?

164
00:10:50,960 --> 00:10:52,759
Why do I even bother asking.

165
00:10:53,039 --> 00:10:54,279
You're hopeless.

166
00:10:56,799 --> 00:10:58,200
You really don't remember?

167
00:10:58,919 --> 00:10:59,759
No.

168
00:11:01,159 --> 00:11:01,960
Sigh.

169
00:11:11,919 --> 00:11:13,000
(The bite mark.)

170
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:15,399
(Does it only appear
when we're... intimate?)

171
00:11:15,799 --> 00:11:16,600
(Pfft!)

172
00:11:17,080 --> 00:11:18,399
(What a lousy setup.)

173
00:11:18,879 --> 00:11:21,200
(Is it always
just about lovey-dovey stuff?)

174
00:11:21,240 --> 00:11:23,720
(Can't we have something that shows)

175
00:11:23,720 --> 00:11:25,240
(how brilliant and exceptional I am?)

176
00:11:28,919 --> 00:11:29,399
You...

177
00:11:29,399 --> 00:11:30,562
What's your name?

178
00:11:34,120 --> 00:11:35,799
My name,

179
00:11:36,080 --> 00:11:37,159
you'd better remember it.

180
00:11:39,559 --> 00:11:44,080
I am Shangguan Ziyan.

181
00:11:51,600 --> 00:11:53,759
Alright, Miss Ziyan.

182
00:11:55,039 --> 00:11:55,879
I will remember it.

183
00:11:57,120 --> 00:11:57,960
Mm.

184
00:11:58,720 --> 00:12:00,240
(If it cures the Stone Curse,)

185
00:12:00,519 --> 00:12:02,240
(a little intimacy is nothing.)

186
00:12:02,399 --> 00:12:04,879
(Young Taoist, I've got you.)

187
00:12:06,650 --> 00:12:07,491
Alright.

188
00:12:09,437 --> 00:12:10,797
Miss Ziyan.

189
00:12:13,039 --> 00:12:14,360
Big-eared Taoist.

190
00:12:15,200 --> 00:12:15,879
Miss Ziyan.

191
00:12:15,879 --> 00:12:17,600
Big-eared Taoist.

192
00:12:17,600 --> 00:12:18,639
Miss Ziyan.

193
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:20,639
Big-eared Taoist.

194
00:12:20,639 --> 00:12:21,919
Miss Ziyan.

195
00:12:38,800 --> 00:12:42,728
♪I drink the rain of this mortal world,
and seek the path I chose♪

196
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:46,173
♪How much sorrow and joy have I known?♪

197
00:12:46,214 --> 00:12:49,728
♪With this flesh and blood,
I chase the distant light♪

198
00:12:49,914 --> 00:12:52,848
♪Just to see clearly
the memories of this drifting life♪

199
00:12:53,128 --> 00:12:59,898
♪Let the wind sweep away
this heavy air of sorrow♪

200
00:13:00,544 --> 00:13:03,400
♪Do not forget the tangled path♪

201
00:13:03,400 --> 00:13:07,880
♪that you and I have crossed♪

202
00:13:08,138 --> 00:13:11,808
♪Let towering waves come crashing down,
I'll fight against the tide♪

203
00:13:11,918 --> 00:13:15,608
♪I shatter
the hollow fate they wrote for me♪

204
00:13:15,780 --> 00:13:22,014
♪With a heart free of regret,
I'll face the heavens and earth♪
